WEBVTT

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.130
Once upon a time, in a land far far away,

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:12.250
there was a barbaric, ruthless, and defiant,

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:14.930
demon-like bastard who thought 
nothing of his fellow man.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.210
What?

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.180
Why the hell are you crying all of a sudden?

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.480
He is sleepy and irritable.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.180
If you're really his parent, 
then you should realize this.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.430
If he's tired, he should just sleep!

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:47.650
If that line of thinking worked, it would 
not be such a struggle to raise a child.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:49.600
Now hurry and put the master to sleep.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:50.940
If you do not...

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:29.800
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:32.130
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a baby.

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:35.760
But this baby is no ordinary baby.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.040
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:23.970
<b>There Is 1 Second Before the Demon Lord's Floods Burst Forth</b>

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:31.980
The ocean?

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:37.480
What is this? A dream?

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.950
Yeah, definitely a dream.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:44.930
That's it. I'm going to wake up, and 
Baby Beel will have wet my bed again.

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:46.380
That old joke.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:49.500
Man... First he cries all 
night, now he wets the bed?

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.620
Wake up, me!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.000
Then after changing the 
sheets, go to sleep again!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.000
You hear me, me?

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:19.780
The hell...?

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:22.560
Awake?

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.900
A fine morning, yes?

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.280
Master is peeing quite splendidly.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:28.920
Peeing?

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.010
Worry not.

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.290
It is not unclean.

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:35.790
On the contrary, it is urine imbued with 
holy magical powers one should give thanks for...

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.810
The great urination comes
each year around this time,

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:41.140
and in the Demon World it is a seasonal attraction.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:45.300
After a city is drowned in the flood, 
the amount of fertile land increases.

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:49.300
The first step in destroying humanity, yes?

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:51.000
This ain't a joke!

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.940
Humanity is being peed to extinction?

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:56.810
And how long are you gonna just sleep there?

00:04:57.170 --> 00:05:01.290
Your peeing is incredible as always, Master!

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:05.340
Floating... Floating... Floating...

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:07.330
Float and stop!

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:10.730
Hey, where are you taking me?

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:12.570
Wait, this is...

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:20.020
I simply wished to show Furuichi-sama 
this splendid urination!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.900
It brings back memories, yes...

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:23.170
Back in the Demon World,

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:26.590
my daughter and I would often amuse
ourselves floating downurine...

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:30.370
You go tubing down urine?!

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.540
Help me!

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:38.600
Hey. Do something about this flood already.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:41.110
Humans, honestly...

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:43.730
So be it.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.070
What the heck?

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:06.380
Ooh, how fierce!

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:11.460
It is an item from the Demon World which 
temporarily sends his pee into an alternate dimension.

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:13.650
It is called "Peebeegone".

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:17.140
The end sounds cutsey. But 
it's just a joke, right?

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.180
Joke, no joke, it doesn't matter.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.150
This way, the city can 
stay above water level.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.150
No, it will flood.

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:27.710
Although it is an alternate 
dimension, it is not infinite.

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:29.930
It will last only 2 to 3 hours.

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:30.780
What?!

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:33.320
Can't we just replace it with a new one?

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.510
There's no spare.

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:35.870
What?!

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:39.760
You people just can't accept your fate.

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:43.550
You should be spending this time 
deciding which city to drown.

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:46.050
Alrighty then! You, shut the hell up!

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:51.850
Okay, he's calmed down for now, but the 
Baby Beel dam is gonna burst at any time!

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:53.550
We cannot let down our guard.

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:56.480
Thankfully, no one is home today at my place.

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.510
Right now we need to come up with a plan.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.540
We've got rip off our brains!

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.340
You mean, wrack our brains!

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.940
Rip them off!

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:09.950
Uh, whatever you say, but 
don't involve me in it.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.710
But you're the only one I can count on!

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:13.340
You got a good idea, right?

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:14.570
No, I don't!

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:15.670
And I don't wanna come up with one!

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:17.110
You'd better come up with one!

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:19.040
Come up with one, or its comin' out, got it?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.710
That's not even close to funny!

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.710
What's with that face?

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.460
Furuichi, you idiot!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.900
You're okay letting Japan 
sink into an ocean of pee?

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:30.060
Shut it!

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:31.770
You're the damn parent, so you do something!

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:35.220
My baby pees so much, I don't know what to do!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.550
No leaks for 10 hours, no matter the amount!

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:41.730
With the mystical diapers "Daipies", 
your baby will be safe and sound!

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:44.510
I'm not scared of leaks anymore!

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:45.780
Daipies!

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:46.730
That's it!

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.620
The news continues.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:51.240
There has just been an armed bank robbery...

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:54.040
Furuichi, you handle cleaning up the house!

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.240
Wait, what do you mean...

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:58.480
What should I do with 
everything soaked like this?

00:07:58.480 --> 00:07:59.710
Fix it back up like it was!

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:00.620
Countin' on ya!

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:05.040
And wait... Normal diapers 
aren't gonna work, obviously.

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:07.540
Just you wait, Baby Beel!

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:09.780
They said no leaks, no matter the amount!

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.680
Sheesh...

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.430
He's such a simpleton.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:19.150
Wait, this is manga <i>I</i> lent him!

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:20.310
You're going to help him?

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.580
Well, a little bit.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.060
'Cause he's a friend, you know.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.630
Ooh, I was totally cool back there!

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:35.070
Even if it's your job, it must be difficult 
raising a baby with that idiot... Right, Hilda?

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.000
That's so right!

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.830
He's such a total nincompoop, you know?

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:43.220
What are we to do with him?

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:49.960
And with that, Hilda-san's 
heart will be mine!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:51.780
Job?

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.570
Do not degenerate it!

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:01.120
You dare to make a mockery 
of my devotion to my master?

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.980
A demon maidservant is just as the name says:

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.440
A demon born with the sole
purpose of serving her master.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:16.110
The person we serve, and the place we serve 
at, are all decided prior to our birth.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.620
Do you understand?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:23.620
My existence itself has no other 
meaning than serving Master Beel!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.260
It is no mere job!

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.750
I'm going after him!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:30.700
Wait!

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:35.510
What am I saying to some human?

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.240
Everything according to my master's will.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:39.880
That is how it is, yes?

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:45.270
Please, wait, Hilda-san!

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:55.440
Welcom...

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.250
Oh, it's Oga-chan!

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:58.030
What's up?

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.180
I'm looking for mystical diapers...

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:01.660
And who are you?

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:03.580
Oh, you mean diapies?

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:08.790
Those got all popular on the internet 
after people posted about them on Chirper.

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:11.430
So we don't have any in stock right now.

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:13.340
You ain't got any?

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.230
If you're looking for diapers, 
we have plenty of other brands.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.970
Take a look at the different kinds.

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.350
<b>Smileypants</b>

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:24.350
You were quite impressive 
back then, Oga-chan.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:25.740
About what?

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:29.550
I hear Kanzaki-kun is going 
to take a month to heal fully.

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:31.940
But after that, things are gonna get busy.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:35.290
Since you did in one of Ishiyama's TKKH.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:35.860
Huh?

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.070
You didn't know?

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.400
Those are the 4 great powers at our school.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:42.790
Tojo, Kunieda, Kanzaki, and Himekawa....

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:46.790
By taking the first letter of each of 
their names, you make the Ishiyama TKKH.

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.060
How about this one, Baby Beel?

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.360
Yeah, no kidding.

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:52.500
These sure ain't mystical diapers to me.

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:54.990
Sheesh...

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.500
How about these?

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:07.700
Stay calm!

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.520
If you don't, you're dead meat!

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.160
Hilda-san!

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:23.800
What?

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.920
This is all the hostages we got?

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:43.970
What the hell is going on?!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.980
According to the report we've just received,

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:02.090
the armed suspects who
robbed Ishiyama Bank escaped

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:06.870
and are holed up in a nearby drug
store! They've taken hostages!

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.700
We bring you a live report...

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.120
We're reporting live from the scene.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.120
<b>Ishiyama Drug</b>

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:14.210
According to the information we have,

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.070
inside the store were 2 high school students,

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:18.380
one cosplaying female, and
what is believed to be a baby.

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:27.760
Oh, my... Oga-chan and the 
gang are caught up inside...

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:30.780
Damn it! We're surrounded by cops!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.110
This is your fault for 
takin' your sweet time!

00:12:34.860 --> 00:12:39.780
Well, as long as we have hostages, 
they can't make their move so easy.

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:51.790
Okay, people. Don't go thinking anything 
stupid like puttin' up a fight.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.180
Armed robbery, grand 
larceny, property damage...

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.290
Six crimes in all!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:58.790
We're the criminal group that 
does every kind of evil deed!

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.160
Ohyama!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.050
Ryuzaki!

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.410
Zenko!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.240
Sannomiya!

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.050
And that makes our name:

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:09.070
orz3!

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:11.100
Sliding grovel!

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.020
Right!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.110
Slide... grovel!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:16.560
Wait! No, you dumbass!

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:24.950
Anyway, you're our hostages until 
we're well on our way to Hong Kong!

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:27.450
Get out of line and we'll 
blast you full of holes.

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:29.730
This is serious!

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:32.850
6 different crimes? These 
guys are bad to the bone!

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:34.320
Did you say bad?

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:37.050
Gotta think of a way to escape...

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:40.390
Think, Furuichi Takayuki, the one 
they call the strategist of Ishiyama!

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:42.210
Hey! What are you doing, Oga?

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:47.360
You idiot... If they're such bad dudes, 
I can dump Baby Beel onto them!

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.300
What's with you?

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:53.720
I thought we said not to move.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.230
So how bad are you?

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:57.730
Huh?

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:02.230
You're robbers right? I asked 
ya just how evil you are.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:05.500
You sure got a big mouth on you, huh?

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:08.740
What're you getting worked 
up about some kid for?

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:12.080
I like the look in your eyes.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:16.080
You got guts. Reminds me 
of when I was younger.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:19.380
Fine then! We'll tell 
you, for your own future!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:22.190
Yes, please do. I'm sure you're all amazing.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:24.180
Ohyama!

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:29.390
When I was your age, I was quite the rebel.

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:34.310
I took all the windows in the school 
and shattered 'em like this!

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:42.440
And then, with the shards of glass, I...

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.380
I'd get rid of extra hairs, like this...

00:14:56.070 --> 00:14:58.330
Is that... evil?

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.390
Honestly speaking... Kind of weak.

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.170
Are you an idiot?

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:07.720
We don't need any bank robbers bragging
about their follicle maintenance!

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:11.680
No mercy!

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.180
Ryuzaki!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:18.010
Back in my juvenile delinquent days, 
there wasn't anyone who could touch me!

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:24.440
Why, you ask? Because I'm from the bowels 
of delinquency, Ishiyama High School!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.990
Oh! I'm also from Ishiyama.

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:32.850
Really? No wonder I thought 
your face looked bad-ass.

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:35.230
How's Ishiyama doin' lately?

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:38.840
In my time, the Big Four 
was the Tanekin Trio.

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:40.980
The Big Four was a trio?

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:42.120
No, see...

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:45.460
Takamizawa, Nemoto, Kindaichi, Torimoto...

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:49.990
If you take the first parts of their 
names, you get "TaNeKin Torioka"

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:53.300
And that Kindaichi guy,
despite being in high school,

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.410
was always so showy and greased up...

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:56.720
He got the nickname...

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:01.420
Tellin' old stories? Don't 
go gettin' carried away!

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.310
Zenkou!

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:08.650
Each and every one of you 
is all about the past...

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:09.740
Pitiful.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:13.360
Listen up. I'm a thief 
that specializes in metal.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:18.620
I steal things like fences and manhole 
covers and sell them for cash.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:21.600
Just a bit before, I did me quite a job.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:24.120
I stole an entire steel tower!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.630
Steel tower?

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:30.480
One of the towers disappeared by the 
river, right? That was my doing.

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:33.020
Sorry, but actually that was me.

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:42.020
Hey, do you think they might 
actually really fail at evil?

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.950
Enough! You guys, stay put!

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:47.650
You know how you go and rob a bank?

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:50.950
I'll teach you.

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:54.560
The second you enter the bank you 
shove a gun through the window,

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:57.620
And you threaten them to 
give you money like this!

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:09.420
Zenkou, how's it look outside?

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.350
Not much activity!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.550
Hey, Baby Beel!

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.220
What is with this kid?

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.550
Baby Beel!

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:22.740
Don't move!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.550
I told you not to move, you!

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:26.850
Get off!

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:30.100
Fine, perfect.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:32.860
I'll be takin' this baby.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:33.860
What?!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:38.360
With a baby as a hostage, the cops 
ain't gonna do anything stupid.

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:40.910
I can carry 'im with one hand, 
so he won't get in the way.

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:43.140
And he can't fight back.

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:46.870
Now that I think about it, this 
is the best possible hostage!

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:53.150
Oga, you did it!

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:57.040
Even if you don't ask this 
guy, he's gonna take him away!

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:59.130
Right... Yeah...

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:02.460
If he really takes Baby 
Beel to Hong Kong with him,

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:04.390
Japan will be saved from the flood!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.270
Wow... Oga, for you, that's good thinking!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.380
Well, duh!

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:23.540
Be a good boy and don't cry anymore, okay?

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:30.320
All my kids are little hellspawns...

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:32.300
Give in to one of their demands, 
and they'll never let up!

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:33.550
I see.

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:38.230
Well, just relax. I'm countin' 
on you becoming his mother.

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:45.580
Yes, Great Demon Lord.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.840
What the hell is this baby?

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:02.250
There are many contracts that are needed for 
you to become the parent of the Demon Lord.

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:04.580
Do you have that conviction?

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:07.090
Parent of the Demon Lord?

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:13.590
In order to destroy humanity, your role is to 
become a catalyst to draw out the master's power.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:17.130
Mow down cities, destroy entire nations...

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:20.280
Help extinguish all remaining 
traces of humanity.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:22.680
That is the role of the Demon Lord's parent.

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:25.990
Sounds interesting!

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:30.200
If I get out of here, I'll be the 
Demon Lord's parent or whatever!

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:32.880
B-Boss, I think this might be dangerous!

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:35.110
That woman ain't normal!

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:38.100
You're seriously gonna 
take that baby with you?

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:39.900
I said shut it, you!

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:43.370
When I ain't got any more use 
for him, I'll just ditch him!

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:48.750
Then I will take you to Hong 
Kong, just as you wish.

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:50.870
Akubaba!

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:03.190
Interesting! Let's go, people!

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:04.260
Hold it a sec.

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.450
Why, you...

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.140
I think you should go all by yourselves.

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:17.150
No holding back for robbers either!

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:23.660
Master?

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.250
Master!

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.110
Baby Beel!

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:47.720
Fast...

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:50.230
It broke already?

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:52.230
Three hours sure fly by...

00:20:56.750 --> 00:21:00.230
Do something, would you? Your supposed 
to act like his mother, right?

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:04.750
I'm countin on you becoming his mother.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.370
Great Demon Lord...

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:12.030
Aww... I thought I'd finally saved Japan.

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:21.280
Grab on. We'll fly to the ocean.

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:41.940
Shouldn't you just have 
done this from the start?

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:44.140
Silence. I'll push you off.

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:49.290
Great Demon Lord... I do 
not understand this man.

00:21:53.190 --> 00:21:59.890
However, it may be too early 
to come to a conclusion.

00:23:32.810 --> 00:23:34.160
We're home!

00:23:36.550 --> 00:23:38.230
Tatsumi, we brought you...

00:23:45.180 --> 00:23:46.660
Um...

00:23:48.940 --> 00:23:49.990
Who are you?

00:24:01.700 --> 00:24:06.950
Himekawa, one of Ishiyama's TKKH, 
is not just strong, he's crazy rich!

00:24:06.950 --> 00:24:08.830
How rich is he?

00:24:08.830 --> 00:24:11.300
Commoners like us can't even fathom it.

00:24:11.300 --> 00:24:15.150
Like, he only takes one bite from 
the best part of a watermelon.

00:24:15.150 --> 00:24:17.770
And then he throws the rest away! Like that.

00:24:19.670 --> 00:24:21.020
On the next Beelzebub:

00:24:21.510 --> 00:24:23.980
There is Nothing Money Can't Buy!

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:26.480
Don't waste food!
